    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.dieselengine.tooltip_secondary.15533=§fDimensions: §63§7x§68§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front left, 2nd layer\n   §621 §fPTFE Frame Box\n   §619 §fChemically Inert Machine Casing\n   §610-15 §fStable Titanium Machine Casing\n   §68 §fEngine Intake Casing\n   §64 §fTitanium Gear Box Casing\n   §e1 §fDynamo Hatch: §7Right center casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any titanium machine casing NOT next to a gearbox\n   §e1 §fMuffler Hatch: §7Any titanium machine casing NOT next to a gearbox\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any titanium machine casing next to a gearbox\n   §fMandatory Air: §74x2 area in front of the engine intake casings\n   \n§cDynamo cannot be greater than 4A\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
