    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine_dronecentre.tooltip_secondary.15568=§fDimensions: §611§7x§611§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §661 §fSteel Pipe Casing\n   §647 §fSteel Frame Box\n   §629 §fHempcrete (any color)\n   §628 §fIron Frame Box\n   §620-26 §fSolid Steel Machine Casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus: §7Any machine casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
